{"author":"schacon@gmail.com","body":"Proposed review flow (documented in docs/docs/review.html):\n\nData model:\n- reviewers: Set field (who is asked to review)\n- reviews: List field like comments: {author, at, verdict, body}\n- Verdicts: approve, reject, comment (latest per reviewer wins)\n\nCommands:\n- ti review request <email> — add a reviewer\n- ti review unrequest <email> — remove a reviewer\n- ti review approve [message] — sign off\n- ti review reject \"reason\" — request changes\n- ti review comment \"note\" — comment without verdict\n- ti review -t <id> (no action) — show review status\n- ti list --state review / ti list --reviewer <email> — find reviewable tickets\n\nFlow:\n1. Author links branch (ti code), requests reviewers, sets state review, syncs\n2. Reviewers sync, submit verdicts (approve/reject/comment), sync\n3. Author sees feedback, fixes, re-requests if needed\n4. All approved -> merge branch, ti close, sync"}